{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】10月29日now早晨新聞重點</p>\n<p>【維持利率不變】美國聯儲局一如預期維持利率不變，主席沃什重申遏制通脹的決心。</p>\n<p>【列車追尾相撞】西班牙兩列高速列車追尾相撞事故，造成最少68人死亡，首相桑切斯宣布全國哀悼三日。</p>\n<p>【皇崗交通安排】萬聖節皇崗口岸高峰時段，公共交通工具將獲優先放行。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T23:20:38.605742+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T23:02:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T23:18:23.516984+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T23:18:23.516984+00:00","content_hash":"d63487d5940cdd8d2b4e1aa40861f6116f1a8ac4aed8c36208e895e857eaa2c2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}